<title>NETHERLANDS: Fortis results by sector.</title>
<headline>Fortis results by sector.</headline>
<dateline>UTRECHT, Netherlands 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996 results in ecu (million) by sector:</p>
<p>INSURANCE OPERATING PROFITS</p>
<p>    - Life insurance		 182    vs  156</p>
<p>    - Non-life insurance	    61    vs   49</p>
<p>    - Other			    105    vs  100</p>
<p>BANKING RESULTS</p>
<p>    - net interest income	  793    vs  665</p>
<p>    - fee income			91    vs   86</p>
<p>    - other income		   168    vs  151</p>
<p>    - costs			    794    vs  699</p>
<p>    General costs		     32    vs    32</p>
<p>    Tax				  162    vs   132</p>
<p>    Third party interests	   97    vs    73</p>
<p>    Net profit			 366    vs   302</p>
